{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDVmTu939MA9g6r5ncy1", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:** 1875 年,乔治·布朗(George Brown,1818–1880,多伦多《环球报》出版人、加拿大联邦之父之一)拒绝了安大略省副总督一职。\n\n- 加拿大百科全书说,他在 1875 年拒绝了安大略省副总督的职位,1879 年又拒绝了爵士头衔。\n- 加拿大公园管理局(Parks Canada)关于他故居的介绍也列出了这两次拒绝。\n- 公园管理局称,他想以报纸编辑的身份保持独立的公共发言权,所以没有接受官职。\n\n**网址:**\n- 加拿大百科全书:https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/george-brown\n- Parks Canada 乔治·布朗故居国家历史遗址:https://parks.canada.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house\n\nSources:\n- [The Canadian Encyclopedia: George Brown](https://thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/george-brown)\n- [Parks Canada: George Brown House National Historic Site](https://parks.canada.ca/culture/designation/lieu-site/maison-george-brown-house)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1088, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4286, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1088}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:34:20.623Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDVmTSMKURsfnqnhSuFL"}
